# Verify Authority Dashboard and Severity Sorting
1. Open http://localhost:3000/authority-login.html
2. Click on the "Sign In" button to enter the Authority Portal.
3. Verify that we are on the Command Overview page by checking that "Command Center" is visible.
4. Click on the "Zone Manager" button in the left side navigation dock.
5. Wait for the "Monitored Hazards" table to load.
6. Look at the severity tier of the first item in the table.
7. Assert that the first item is marked as "Critical" or "Red" severity, confirming that our severity ranking logic is placing critical hazards at the top.
